concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-1-sec-45aa a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "45AA Simplified outline"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-45aa ;
    values:originalText "The following is a simplified outline of this Division: • This Division sets out parallel offences and civil penalty provisions relating to cartel conduct. • A person must not make, or give effect to, a contract, arrangement or understanding that contains a cartel provision. • A cartel provision is a provision relating to:  (a) price-fixing; or  (b) restricting outputs in the production and supply chain; or  (c) allocating customers, suppliers or territories; or  (d) bid-rigging;  by parties that are, or would otherwise be, in competition with each other." ;
    skos:definition "The following is a simplified outline of this Division: • This Division sets out parallel offences and civil penalty provisions relating to cartel conduct. • A person must not make, or give effect to, a contract, arrangement or understanding that contains a cartel provision. • A cartel provision is a provision relating to:  (a) price-fixing; or  (b) restricting outputs in the production and supply chain; or  (c) allocating customers, suppliers or territories; or  (d) bid-rigging;  by parties that are, or would otherwise be, in competition with each other."@en ;
