concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-1-sec-45af a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "45AF Making a contract etc. containing a cartel provision"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-45af ;
    values:originalText "Offence  (1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person makes a contract or arrangement, or arrives at an understanding; and  (b) the contract, arrangement or understanding contains a cartel provision.  (2) The fault element for paragraph (1)(b) is knowledge or belief. Penalty  (3) An offence against subsection (1) committed by a body corporate is punishable on conviction by a fine not exceeding the greater of the following:  (a) $100,000,000;  Schedule 1  The Schedule version of Part IV" ;
    skos:definition "Offence  (1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person makes a contract or arrangement, or arrives at an understanding; and  (b) the contract, arrangement or understanding contains a cartel provision.  (2) The fault element for paragraph (1)(b) is knowledge or belief. Penalty  (3) An offence against subsection (1) committed by a body corporate is punishable on conviction by a fine not exceeding the greater of the following:  (a) $100,000,000;  Schedule 1  The Schedule version of Part IV"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "cd25b8565d4b57e8f856cf50c696d80d49eb0c79087d2888c0de2bddefadce7e" ;
    cof:pageNumber "29"^^xsd:integer ;
