    values:originalText "(2) A person cannot be found guilty of an offence against section 45AF or 45AG if:  (a) all other parties to the contract, arrangement or understanding have been acquitted of such an offence; and  Schedule 1  The Schedule version of Part IV" ;
    skos:definition "(2) A person cannot be found guilty of an offence against section 45AF or 45AG if:  (a) all other parties to the contract, arrangement or understanding have been acquitted of such an offence; and  Schedule 1  The Schedule version of Part IV"@en ;
