concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-1-sec-45ak a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "45AK Giving effect to a cartel provision"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-45ak ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person contravenes this section if:  (a) a contract, arrangement or understanding contains a cartel provision; and  (b) the person gives effect to the cartel provision.  The Schedule version of Part IV  Schedule 1 Schedule version of Part IV  Part 1 Cartel conduct  Division 1  Section 45AL  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  Note: For enforcement, see Part VI.  (2) Paragraph (1)(a) applies to contracts or arrangements made, or understandings arrived at, before, at or after the commencement of this section. Subdivision D—Exceptions" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A person contravenes this section if:  (a) a contract, arrangement or understanding contains a cartel provision; and  (b) the person gives effect to the cartel provision.  The Schedule version of Part IV  Schedule 1 Schedule version of Part IV  Part 1 Cartel conduct  Division 1  Section 45AL  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  Note: For enforcement, see Part VI.  (2) Paragraph (1)(a) applies to contracts or arrangements made, or understandings arrived at, before, at or after the commencement of this section. Subdivision D—Exceptions"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "feb186784d2558c2992a86b231892210d5538fcbd46c8dbc0fb48e70a6a479ed" ;
    cof:pageNumber "32"^^xsd:integer ;
