concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-1-sec-45an a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "45AN Contracts, arrangements or understandings between related"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-45an ;
    values:originalText "bodies corporate  (1) Sections 45AF, 45AG, 45AJ and 45AK do not apply in relation to a contract, arrangement or understanding if the only parties to the contract, arrangement or understanding are bodies corporate that are related to each other.  (2) A person who wishes to rely on subsection (1) bears an evidential burden in relation to that matter." ;
    skos:definition "bodies corporate  (1) Sections 45AF, 45AG, 45AJ and 45AK do not apply in relation to a contract, arrangement or understanding if the only parties to the contract, arrangement or understanding are bodies corporate that are related to each other.  (2) A person who wishes to rely on subsection (1) bears an evidential burden in relation to that matter."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a6a4208d48c2f887281312b9ede7a7cc13256610ce7c9de89f2eed59015a360b" ;
