concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-1-sec-45au a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "45AU Collective acquisition of goods or services by the parties to a"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-45au ;
    values:originalText "contract, arrangement or understanding  (1) Sections 45AF, 45AG, 45AJ and 45AK do not apply in relation to a contract, arrangement or understanding containing a cartel provision, in so far as:  (a) the cartel provision has the purpose, or has or is likely to have the effect, mentioned in subsection 45AD(2); and  (b) either:  (i) the cartel provision relates to the price for goods or services to be collectively acquired, whether directly or indirectly, by the parties to the contract, arrangement or understanding; or  (ii) the cartel provision is for the joint advertising of the price for the re-supply of goods or services so acquired.  (2) A person who wishes to rely on subsection (1) bears an evidential burden in relation to that matter.  Schedule 1  The Schedule version of Part IV" ;
    skos:definition "contract, arrangement or understanding  (1) Sections 45AF, 45AG, 45AJ and 45AK do not apply in relation to a contract, arrangement or understanding containing a cartel provision, in so far as:  (a) the cartel provision has the purpose, or has or is likely to have the effect, mentioned in subsection 45AD(2); and  (b) either:  (i) the cartel provision relates to the price for goods or services to be collectively acquired, whether directly or indirectly, by the parties to the contract, arrangement or understanding; or  (ii) the cartel provision is for the joint advertising of the price for the re-supply of goods or services so acquired.  (2) A person who wishes to rely on subsection (1) bears an evidential burden in relation to that matter.  Schedule 1  The Schedule version of Part IV"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f10ba900c36078edafab0fd04c25b660d50d50028ee8075a9dc529f1be6361c4" ;
    cof:pageNumber "39"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-1-sec-45au-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-1-sec-45au-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.39" .
doc:sch-1-sec-45au a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "45AU Collective acquisition of goods or services by the parties to a" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "contract, arrangement or understanding  (1) Sections 45AF, 45AG, 45AJ and 45AK do not apply in relation to a contract, arrangement or understanding containing a cartel provision, in so far as:  (a) the cartel provision has the purpose, or has or is likely to have the effect, mentioned in subsection 45AD(2); and  (b) either:  (i) the cartel provision relates to the price for goods or services to be collectively acquired, whether directly or indirectly, by the parties to the contract, arrangement or understanding; or  (ii) the cartel provision is for the joint advertising of the price for the re-supply of goods or services so acquired.  (2) A person who wishes to rely on subsection (1) bears an evidential burden in relation to that matter.  Schedule 1  The Schedule version of Part IV" ;
    cof:pageNumber "39"^^xsd:integer .

