concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-1-sec-45ax-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "45AX(3) Commission must be notified of material changes of fact in"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-45ax-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) This section also applies if:  (a) a person is the notifying party of a notification of an acquisition; and  (b) the notifying party has made a public benefit application in relation to the notification; and  (c) a change of fact occurs; and  Schedule 1  The Schedule version of Part IV" ;
    skos:definition "(3) This section also applies if:  (a) a person is the notifying party of a notification of an acquisition; and  (b) the notifying party has made a public benefit application in relation to the notification; and  (c) a change of fact occurs; and  Schedule 1  The Schedule version of Part IV"@en ;
