doc:sch-1-sec-45az-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "45AZ(1) Conditions must be complied with" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section applies to an acquisition that is put into effect in contravention of section 45AY." ;
    cof:pageNumber "43"^^xsd:integer .

concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-1-sec-45az-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "45AZ(2) Conditions must be complied with"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-45az-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The acquisition is, and is taken always to have been, void by force of this subsection. Subdivision D—Miscellaneous 45AZB  Providing false or misleading information  A person contravenes this section if:  (a) the person gives information to the Commission or the Tribunal under an acquisitions provision; and  (b) the information is false or misleading in a material particular; and  (c) the person knows that, or is reckless as to whether, the information is false or misleading in a material particular. Note: For enforcement, see Part VI.  Schedule 1  The Schedule version of Part IV" ;
    skos:definition "(2) The acquisition is, and is taken always to have been, void by force of this subsection. Subdivision D—Miscellaneous 45AZB  Providing false or misleading information  A person contravenes this section if:  (a) the person gives information to the Commission or the Tribunal under an acquisitions provision; and  (b) the information is false or misleading in a material particular; and  (c) the person knows that, or is reckless as to whether, the information is false or misleading in a material particular. Note: For enforcement, see Part VI.  Schedule 1  The Schedule version of Part IV"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f6f0799b5ab13277ed90d4696dd71054b0536f5f0175aadb292482bb344279ef" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-1-sec-45az ;
    cof:pageNumber "43"^^xsd:integer ;
