concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-1-sec-45dc a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "45DC Involvement and liability of employee organisations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-45dc ;
    values:originalText "Certain organisations taken to be acting in concert  (1) If 2 or more persons (the participants), each of whom is a member or officer of the same organisation of employees, engage in conduct in concert with one another, whether or not the conduct is also engaged in in concert with another person, then, unless the organisation proves otherwise, the organisation is taken for the purposes of sections 45D and 45DA:  Schedule 1  The Schedule version of Part IV" ;
    skos:definition "Certain organisations taken to be acting in concert  (1) If 2 or more persons (the participants), each of whom is a member or officer of the same organisation of employees, engage in conduct in concert with one another, whether or not the conduct is also engaged in in concert with another person, then, unless the organisation proves otherwise, the organisation is taken for the purposes of sections 45D and 45DA:  Schedule 1  The Schedule version of Part IV"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c49921a51b0f8be1b1ec8708982b6677830530ac205f31b8cf6f773bac5cf606" ;
    cof:pageNumber "49"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Organisation is liable for conduct in concert with members or officers" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
