concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-1-sec-48 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "48 Resale price maintenance"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-48 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person shall not engage in the practice of resale price maintenance.  (2) Subsection (1) does not apply to a person engaging in conduct that constitutes the practice of resale price maintenance if:  (a) the person has given the Commission a notice under subsection 93(1) describing the conduct; and  (b) the notice is in force under section 93." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A person shall not engage in the practice of resale price maintenance.  (2) Subsection (1) does not apply to a person engaging in conduct that constitutes the practice of resale price maintenance if:  (a) the person has given the Commission a notice under subsection 93(1) describing the conduct; and  (b) the notice is in force under section 93."@en ;
