    cof:title "3(6) Meaning of consumer" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(6) For the purposes of subsection (1) or (3), the amount paid or payable for goods or services acquired by a person other than by way of purchase is taken to be the price at which, at the time of the acquisition, the person could have purchased the goods or services from the supplier, unless subsection (7) or (8) applies." ;
