doc:sch-2-sec-3-ss-9 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "3(9) Meaning of consumer" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(9) If:  (a) a person obtains credit in connection with the acquisition of goods or services by him or her; and  (b) the amount paid or payable by him or her for the goods or services is increased because he or she so obtains credit; obtaining the credit is taken for the purposes of subsection (3) to be the acquisition of a service, and the amount paid or payable by him or her for the service of being provided with the credit is taken to include the amount of the increase. Presumption that persons are consumers" ;
    cof:pageNumber "107"^^xsd:integer .

concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-3-ss-10 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3(10) Meaning of consumer"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-3-ss-10 ;
    values:originalText "(10) If it is alleged in any proceeding under this Schedule, or in any other proceeding in respect of a matter arising under this Schedule, that a person was a consumer in relation to particular goods or services, it is presumed, unless the contrary is established, that the person was a consumer in relation to those goods or services. Mixed supplies" ;
    skos:definition "(10) If it is alleged in any proceeding under this Schedule, or in any other proceeding in respect of a matter arising under this Schedule, that a person was a consumer in relation to particular goods or services, it is presumed, unless the contrary is established, that the person was a consumer in relation to those goods or services. Mixed supplies"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e8bfa01551dc2a9ce77a226e347f1052ba51108767bc036e2724413069558917" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-3 ;
    cof:pageNumber "107"^^xsd:integer ;
