concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-23-ss-2b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23(2B) Unfair terms of consumer contracts and small business contracts"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-23-ss-2b ;
    values:originalText "(2B) A person who contravenes subsection (2A) commits a separate contravention of that subsection in respect of each term that is unfair and that the person proposed." ;
