concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-23-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23(3) Unfair terms of consumer contracts and small business contracts"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-23-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) A consumer contract is a contract for:  The Australian Consumer Law  Schedule 2 General protections  Chapter 2 Unfair contract terms  Part 2-3  Section 23  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (a) a supply of goods or services; or  (b) a sale or grant of an interest in land; to an individual whose acquisition of the goods, services or interest is wholly or predominantly for personal, domestic or household use or consumption." ;
    skos:definition "(3) A consumer contract is a contract for:  The Australian Consumer Law  Schedule 2 General protections  Chapter 2 Unfair contract terms  Part 2-3  Section 23  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (a) a supply of goods or services; or  (b) a sale or grant of an interest in land; to an individual whose acquisition of the goods, services or interest is wholly or predominantly for personal, domestic or household use or consumption."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b44a1b29259f908ab45252e321c43a368f244527a33caadd9d6aab3e1002fbe5" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-23 ;
    cof:pageNumber "128"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Definition of a consumer contract" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
