doc:sch-2-sec-29-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "29(2) False or misleading representations about goods or services" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) For the purposes of applying subsection (1) in relation to a proceeding concerning a representation of a kind referred to in subsection (1)(e) or (f), the representation is taken to be misleading unless evidence is adduced to the contrary." ;
    cof:pageNumber "136"^^xsd:integer .

concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-29-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "29(3) False or misleading representations about goods or services"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-29-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) To avoid doubt, subsection (2) does not:  (a) have the effect that, merely because such evidence to the contrary is adduced, the representation is not misleading; or  (b) have the effect of placing on any person an onus of proving that the representation is not misleading.  Schedule 2  The Australian Consumer Law Chapter 3  Specific protections" ;
    skos:definition "(3) To avoid doubt, subsection (2) does not:  (a) have the effect that, merely because such evidence to the contrary is adduced, the representation is not misleading; or  (b) have the effect of placing on any person an onus of proving that the representation is not misleading.  Schedule 2  The Australian Consumer Law Chapter 3  Specific protections"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d16e2af24a976cb1d11a59e522f9efae75465a47372f3d705fe0bf7be1618266" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-29 ;
    cof:pageNumber "136"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Avoids placing an onus of proving a representation is not misleading." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.136" ;
