concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-39-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "39(6) Unsolicited cards etc."@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-39-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) A debit card is:  (a) an article intended for use by a person in obtaining access to an account that is held by the person for the purpose of withdrawing or depositing cash or obtaining goods or services; or  (b) an article that may be used as an article referred to in paragraph (a)." ;
    skos:definition "(6) A debit card is:  (a) an article intended for use by a person in obtaining access to an account that is held by the person for the purpose of withdrawing or depositing cash or obtaining goods or services; or  (b) an article that may be used as an article referred to in paragraph (a)."@en ;
