doc:sch-2-sec-41-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "41(4) Liability etc. of recipient for unsolicited goods" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) The recovery period is whichever of the following periods ends first:  (a) the period of 3 months starting on the day after the day on which the person received the goods;  (b) if the person who receives the unsolicited goods gives notice with respect to the goods to the supplier or sender in accordance with subsection (5)—the period of one month starting on the day after the day on which the notice is given." ;
    cof:pageNumber "148"^^xsd:integer .

concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-41-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41(5) Liability etc. of recipient for unsolicited goods"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-41-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) A notice under subsection (4)(b):  (a) must be in writing; and  (b) must state the name and address of the person who received the goods; and  (c) must state the address at which possession may be taken of the goods, if it is not the address of the person; and  (d) must contain a statement to the effect that the goods are unsolicited goods." ;
    skos:definition "(5) A notice under subsection (4)(b):  (a) must be in writing; and  (b) must state the name and address of the person who received the goods; and  (c) must state the address at which possession may be taken of the goods, if it is not the address of the person; and  (d) must contain a statement to the effect that the goods are unsolicited goods."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "39d5407e40514cf422b4d6d436bd5b2371a9e31cfe8f1a6c35c5f4ce26c72ad7" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-41 ;
    cof:pageNumber "148"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Notice requirements for unsolicited goods" ;
    dc:description "name and address of the person who received the goods, address at which possession may be taken of the goods, statement that the goods are unsolicited goods" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
