concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-51 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "51 Guarantee as to title"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-51 ;
    values:originalText "(1) If a person (the supplier) supplies goods to a consumer, there is a guarantee that the supplier will have a right to dispose of the property in the goods when that property is to pass to the consumer.  (2) Subsection (1) does not apply to a supply (a supply of limited title) if an intention that the supplier of the goods should transfer only such title as the supplier, or another person, may have:  (a) appears from the contract for the supply; or  (b) is to be inferred from the circumstances of that contract.  (3) This section does not apply if the supply is a supply by way of hire or lease." ;
    skos:definition "(1) If a person (the supplier) supplies goods to a consumer, there is a guarantee that the supplier will have a right to dispose of the property in the goods when that property is to pass to the consumer.  (2) Subsection (1) does not apply to a supply (a supply of limited title) if an intention that the supplier of the goods should transfer only such title as the supplier, or another person, may have:  (a) appears from the contract for the supply; or  (b) is to be inferred from the circumstances of that contract.  (3) This section does not apply if the supply is a supply by way of hire or lease."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0a9c8032336b6650aa7fd60744be0e81fc963521d5a9d394bec2b5fceaefe4e0" ;
    cof:pageNumber "161"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-51-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-51-ss-2 ;
