    values:originalText "(2) This section does not apply if the manufacturer took reasonable action to ensure that the consumer would be given written notice, at or before the time when the consumer agrees to the supply of the goods, that:  (a) facilities for the repair of the goods would not be available or would not be available after a specified period; or  (b) parts for the goods would not be available or would not be available after a specified period." ;
    skos:definition "(2) This section does not apply if the manufacturer took reasonable action to ensure that the consumer would be given written notice, at or before the time when the consumer agrees to the supply of the goods, that:  (a) facilities for the repair of the goods would not be available or would not be available after a specified period; or  (b) parts for the goods would not be available or would not be available after a specified period."@en ;
