concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-69-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "69(2) Meaning of unsolicited consumer agreement"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-69-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) An invitation merely to quote a price for a supply is not taken, for the purposes of subsection (1)(c), to be an invitation to enter into negotiations for a supply." ;
