concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-69-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "69(4) Meaning of unsolicited consumer agreement"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-69-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) However, despite subsections (1) and (3), an agreement is not an unsolicited consumer agreement if it is an agreement of a kind that the regulations provide are not unsolicited consumer agreements." ;
    skos:definition "(4) However, despite subsections (1) and (3), an agreement is not an unsolicited consumer agreement if it is an agreement of a kind that the regulations provide are not unsolicited consumer agreements."@en ;
