doc:sch-2-sec-80 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "80 Additional requirements for unsolicited consumer agreements" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "not negotiated by telephone  The supplier under an unsolicited consumer agreement that was not negotiated by telephone must ensure that, in addition to complying with the requirements of section 79, the agreement complies with the following requirements:  (a) the agreement must be signed by the consumer under the agreement;  (b) if the agreement is signed by a person on the supplier’s behalf—the agreement must state that the person is acting on the supplier’s behalf, and must set out in full:  Schedule 2  The Australian Consumer Law Chapter 3  Specific protections" ;
    cof:pageNumber "181"^^xsd:integer .

concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-81 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "81 Requirements for amendments of unsolicited consumer"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-81 ;
    values:originalText "agreements  The supplier under an unsolicited consumer agreement must ensure that any amendments to the agreement are signed by both parties to the agreement. Note: A pecuniary penalty may be imposed for a contravention of this section. Subdivision D—Terminating unsolicited consumer agreements" ;
    skos:definition "agreements  The supplier under an unsolicited consumer agreement must ensure that any amendments to the agreement are signed by both parties to the agreement. Note: A pecuniary penalty may be imposed for a contravention of this section. Subdivision D—Terminating unsolicited consumer agreements"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "af469bcb12850238eeb533bff5da741d7164688ed1e3311e541654a5c8fa68e5" ;
    cof:pageNumber "182"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Both parties must sign amendments to unsolicited consumer agreements." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.182" ;
    cml:asserts concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-81-norm .
