concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-93 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "93 Effect of contravening this Division"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-93 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The supplier under an unsolicited consumer agreement cannot enforce the agreement against the consumer under the agreement if a provision of this Division (other than section 85) has been contravened in relation to the agreement.  (2) This section does not prevent any action being taken under this Schedule in relation to the contravention." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The supplier under an unsolicited consumer agreement cannot enforce the agreement against the consumer under the agreement if a provision of this Division (other than section 85) has been contravened in relation to the agreement.  (2) This section does not prevent any action being taken under this Schedule in relation to the contravention."@en ;
