concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-95 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "95 Application of this Division to certain conduct covered by the"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-95 ;
    values:originalText "Corporations Act  This Division does not apply in relation to conduct to which section 992A of the Corporations Act 2001 applies. Note: Section 992A of the Corporations Act 2001 prohibits hawking of financial products.  Schedule 2  The Australian Consumer Law Chapter 3  Specific protections" ;
    skos:definition "Corporations Act  This Division does not apply in relation to conduct to which section 992A of the Corporations Act 2001 applies. Note: Section 992A of the Corporations Act 2001 prohibits hawking of financial products.  Schedule 2  The Australian Consumer Law Chapter 3  Specific protections"@en ;
