doc:sch-2-sec-99e a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "99E Post-supply fees not to be demanded or received" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "A person must not, in trade or commerce, demand or receive payment of a post-supply fee in relation to a gift card. Note: A pecuniary penalty may be imposed for a contravention of this subsection.  The Australian Consumer Law  Schedule 2 Specific protections  Chapter 3 Consumer transactions  Part 3-2  Section 99F  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026" ;
