doc:sch-2-sec-104-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "104(2) Making safety standards for consumer goods and product" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), a safety standard for consumer goods of a particular kind may consist of requirements about the following matters:  (a) the performance, composition, contents, methods of manufacture or processing, design, construction, finish or packaging of consumer goods of that kind;  (b) the testing of consumer goods of that kind during, or after the completion of, manufacture or processing;  (c) the form and content of markings to accompany consumer goods of that kind;  (d) the form and content of warnings, instructions or other information about consumer goods of that kind." ;
    cof:pageNumber "203"^^xsd:integer .

concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-104-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "104(3) Making safety standards for consumer goods and product"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-104-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Without limiting subsection (1), a safety standard for product related services of a particular kind may consist of requirements about the following matters:  (a) the manner in which services of that kind are supplied (including, but not limited to, the method of supply);  (b) the skills or qualifications of persons who supply such services;  (c) the materials used in supplying such services;  Schedule 2  The Australian Consumer Law Chapter 3  Specific protections" ;
    skos:definition "(3) Without limiting subsection (1), a safety standard for product related services of a particular kind may consist of requirements about the following matters:  (a) the manner in which services of that kind are supplied (including, but not limited to, the method of supply);  (b) the skills or qualifications of persons who supply such services;  (c) the materials used in supplying such services;  Schedule 2  The Australian Consumer Law Chapter 3  Specific protections"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0a55e30118b58215847d2a812c6f5b04c53132b7cfa341cb6d51f20074fb5855" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-104 ;
    cof:pageNumber "203"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Safety standards for product-related services may require specific matters such as supply method, personnel skills, and materials." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.203" ;
    cml:asserts concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-104-ss-3-norm .
