concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-107-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "107(3) Supplying etc. product related services that do not comply with"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-107-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) If:  (a) a person supplies product related services in contravention of this section; and  (b) another person suffers loss or damage:  (i) because of defect in, or a dangerous characteristic of, consumer goods that results from the services being supplied; or  (ii) because of a reasonably foreseeable use (including a misuse) of consumer goods that results from the services being supplied; or  (iii) because, contrary to the safety standard, he or she was not provided with particular information in relation to the services; and  (c) the other person would not have suffered the loss or damage if the services had complied with the safety standard; the other person is taken, for the purposes of this Schedule, to have suffered the loss or damage because of that supply.  The Australian Consumer Law  Schedule 2 Specific protections  Chapter 3 Safety of consumer goods and product related services  Part 3-3  Section 108  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(3) If:  (a) a person supplies product related services in contravention of this section; and  (b) another person suffers loss or damage:  (i) because of defect in, or a dangerous characteristic of, consumer goods that results from the services being supplied; or  (ii) because of a reasonably foreseeable use (including a misuse) of consumer goods that results from the services being supplied; or  (iii) because, contrary to the safety standard, he or she was not provided with particular information in relation to the services; and  (c) the other person would not have suffered the loss or damage if the services had complied with the safety standard; the other person is taken, for the purposes of this Schedule, to have suffered the loss or damage because of that supply.  The Australian Consumer Law  Schedule 2 Specific protections  Chapter 3 Safety of consumer goods and product related services  Part 3-3  Section 108  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "309b47403d3b86c34c7cdcd0d654e601d1d66149496ce682ed490dd54b916b87" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-107 ;
    cof:pageNumber "206"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "If a person supplies product related services in contravention of this section, and another person suffers loss or damage because of that supply, the other person is taken to have suffered the loss or damage." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
