doc:sch-2-sec-113 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "113 Revocation of interim bans" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "If a responsible Minister imposes an interim ban:  (a) the responsible Minister may, by written notice published on the internet, revoke the ban at any time; and  (b) the ban ceases to be in force on the day specified by the responsible Minister in the notice. Subdivision B—Permanent bans" ;
