concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-119 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "119 Supplying etc. product related services covered by a ban"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-119 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person must not, in trade or commerce, supply product related services of a particular kind if:  (a) an interim ban on services of that kind is in force in the place where the supply occurs; or  (b) a permanent ban on services of that kind is in force. Note: A pecuniary penalty may be imposed for a contravention of this subsection.  (2) A person must not, in trade or commerce, offer for supply product related services the supply of which is prohibited by subsection (1).  Schedule 2  The Australian Consumer Law Chapter 3  Specific protections" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A person must not, in trade or commerce, supply product related services of a particular kind if:  (a) an interim ban on services of that kind is in force in the place where the supply occurs; or  (b) a permanent ban on services of that kind is in force. Note: A pecuniary penalty may be imposed for a contravention of this subsection.  (2) A person must not, in trade or commerce, offer for supply product related services the supply of which is prohibited by subsection (1).  Schedule 2  The Australian Consumer Law Chapter 3  Specific protections"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b008c7fd07becf07fbe0ca6732d2cc7e498d7a41c70be068e8b0f85aaa5712c1" ;
    cof:pageNumber "215"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-119-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-119-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
