doc:sch-2-sec-161-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "161(4) Unsolicited cards etc." ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) A person commits an offence if the person takes any action that enables another person who has a debit card to use the card as a credit card.  The Australian Consumer Law  Schedule 2 Offences  Chapter 4 Offences relating to unfair practices  Part 4-1  Section 162  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026" ;
    cof:pageNumber "262"^^xsd:integer .

