    values:originalText "(5A) An offence against subsection (1) or (2) committed by a body corporate is punishable on conviction by a fine of not more than the greater of the following:  (a) $100,000,000;  (b) if the court can determine the value of the benefit that the body corporate, and any body corporate related to the body  Schedule 2  The Australian Consumer Law Chapter 4  Offences" ;
