concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-170 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "170 Permitted hours for negotiating an unsolicited consumer"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-170 ;
    values:originalText "agreement  (1) A dealer commits an offence if the dealer calls on a person for the purpose of negotiating an unsolicited consumer agreement, or for an incidental or related purpose:  (a) at any time on a Sunday or a public holiday; or  (b) before 9 am on any other day; or  (c) after 6 pm on any other day (or after 5 pm if the other day is a Saturday). Penalty:  (a) if the person is a body corporate—$50,000; or  (b) if the person is not a body corporate—$10,000.  (2) Subsection (1) does not apply if the dealer calls on, or telephones, the person in accordance with consent that:  (a) was given by the person to the dealer or a person acting on the dealer’s behalf; and  (b) was not given in the presence of the dealer or a person acting on the dealer’s behalf.  (3) Subsection (1) is an offence of strict liability." ;
    skos:definition "agreement  (1) A dealer commits an offence if the dealer calls on a person for the purpose of negotiating an unsolicited consumer agreement, or for an incidental or related purpose:  (a) at any time on a Sunday or a public holiday; or  (b) before 9 am on any other day; or  (c) after 6 pm on any other day (or after 5 pm if the other day is a Saturday). Penalty:  (a) if the person is a body corporate—$50,000; or  (b) if the person is not a body corporate—$10,000.  (2) Subsection (1) does not apply if the dealer calls on, or telephones, the person in accordance with consent that:  (a) was given by the person to the dealer or a person acting on the dealer’s behalf; and  (b) was not given in the presence of the dealer or a person acting on the dealer’s behalf.  (3) Subsection (1) is an offence of strict liability."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "46a81739c6ee7c1d5ed084e7de843a7ed79435cd445513e4dd5c4e5ac395fb4b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "275"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-170-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-170-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-170-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
