    values:originalText "(2) Subsection (1) does not apply if the dealer calls on, or telephones, the person in accordance with consent that:  (a) was given by the person to the dealer or a person acting on the dealer’s behalf; and  (b) was not given in the presence of the dealer or a person acting on the dealer’s behalf." ;
    cof:pageNumber "275"^^xsd:integer .

