concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-184 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "184 Application of this Division to persons to whom rights of"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-184 ;
    values:originalText "consumers and suppliers are assigned etc.  (1) This Division applies in relation to a person to whom the rights of a consumer (the original consumer) under a contract for the supply of goods or services are assigned or transferred, or pass by operation of law, (whether from the original consumer or from another person) as if the person were the original consumer.  Schedule 2  The Australian Consumer Law Chapter 4  Offences" ;
    skos:definition "consumers and suppliers are assigned etc.  (1) This Division applies in relation to a person to whom the rights of a consumer (the original consumer) under a contract for the supply of goods or services are assigned or transferred, or pass by operation of law, (whether from the original consumer or from another person) as if the person were the original consumer.  Schedule 2  The Australian Consumer Law Chapter 4  Offences"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e8802c11a7268ab71feddefd5628f5a8c319fcff0dcdae589a4a489ab8ce854e" ;
    cof:pageNumber "285"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "This Division applies in relation to a person to whom the rights of a consumer under a contract for the supply of goods or services are assigned or transferred, as if the person were the original consumer." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
