concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-186 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "186 Regulations may limit the application of this Division"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-186 ;
    values:originalText "This Division (other than section 170) does not apply, or provisions of this Division (other than section 170) that are specified in regulations made for the purposes of section 94 do not apply, to or in relation to:  (a) circumstances of a kind specified in those regulations; or  (b) agreements of a kind specified in those regulations; or  (c) the conduct of businesses of a kind specified in those regulations." ;
    skos:definition "This Division (other than section 170) does not apply, or provisions of this Division (other than section 170) that are specified in regulations made for the purposes of section 94 do not apply, to or in relation to:  (a) circumstances of a kind specified in those regulations; or  (b) agreements of a kind specified in those regulations; or  (c) the conduct of businesses of a kind specified in those regulations."@en ;
