concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-198 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "198 Supplying etc. product related services covered by a ban"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-198 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person, in trade or commerce, supplies product related services of a particular kind; and  (b) either:  (i) an interim ban on services of that kind is in force in the place where the supply occurs; or  (ii) a permanent ban on services of that kind is in force.  (2) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person, in trade or commerce, offers for supply product related services of a particular kind; and  (b) the supply would be prohibited by subsection (1).  (3) Subsections (1) and (2) are offences of strict liability.  Schedule 2  The Australian Consumer Law Chapter 4  Offences" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person, in trade or commerce, supplies product related services of a particular kind; and  (b) either:  (i) an interim ban on services of that kind is in force in the place where the supply occurs; or  (ii) a permanent ban on services of that kind is in force.  (2) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person, in trade or commerce, offers for supply product related services of a particular kind; and  (b) the supply would be prohibited by subsection (1).  (3) Subsections (1) and (2) are offences of strict liability.  Schedule 2  The Australian Consumer Law Chapter 4  Offences"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "bc21784f2f76d718cf7a2e15e12cb4eb6b03d7d01d000b8273e06f65f2f33a81" ;
    cof:pageNumber "297"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-198-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-198-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-198-ss-3 ;
