concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-203-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "203(3) Supplying etc. goods that do not comply with information"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-203-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person, in or for the purposes of trade or commerce, manufactures, possesses or has control of goods of a particular kind; and  (b) an information standard for goods of that kind is in force; and  (c) the person has not complied with the standard in relation to the goods." ;
    skos:definition "(3) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person, in or for the purposes of trade or commerce, manufactures, possesses or has control of goods of a particular kind; and  (b) an information standard for goods of that kind is in force; and  (c) the person has not complied with the standard in relation to the goods."@en ;
