concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-230 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "230 Certain indemnities not authorised and certain documents void"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-230 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Section 229 does not authorise anything that would otherwise be unlawful.  (2) Anything that purports to indemnify a person against a liability is void to the extent that it contravenes section 229.  Schedule 2  The Australian Consumer Law Chapter 5  Enforcement and remedies" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Section 229 does not authorise anything that would otherwise be unlawful.  (2) Anything that purports to indemnify a person against a liability is void to the extent that it contravenes section 229.  Schedule 2  The Australian Consumer Law Chapter 5  Enforcement and remedies"@en ;
