concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-232-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "232(5) Injunctions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-232-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) Without limiting subsection (1), the court may grant an injunction under that subsection restraining a person from carrying on a  The Australian Consumer Law  Schedule 2 Enforcement and remedies  Chapter 5 Remedies  Part 5-2  Section 233  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  business or supplying goods or services (whether or not as part of, or incidental to, the carrying on of another business):  (a) for a specified period; or  (b) except on specified terms and conditions." ;
    skos:definition "(5) Without limiting subsection (1), the court may grant an injunction under that subsection restraining a person from carrying on a  The Australian Consumer Law  Schedule 2 Enforcement and remedies  Chapter 5 Remedies  Part 5-2  Section 233  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  business or supplying goods or services (whether or not as part of, or incidental to, the carrying on of another business):  (a) for a specified period; or  (b) except on specified terms and conditions."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d88519fd205c8633e511c559b94e15affac58176a75297e237a5ffb5a46a8980" ;
