concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-232-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "232(6) Injunctions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-232-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) Without limiting subsection (1), the court may grant an injunction under that subsection requiring a person to do any of the following:  (a) refund money;  (b) transfer property;  (c) honour a promise;  (d) destroy or dispose of goods." ;
    skos:definition "(6) Without limiting subsection (1), the court may grant an injunction under that subsection requiring a person to do any of the following:  (a) refund money;  (b) transfer property;  (c) honour a promise;  (d) destroy or dispose of goods."@en ;
