    values:originalText "(1) An application may be made under section 237(1), 239(1), 243A(1) or 243B(1) even if an enforcement proceeding in relation to the conduct or term referred to in that section has not been instituted.  (2) A court may make an order under a provision of this Division whether or not the court:  Schedule 2  The Australian Consumer Law Chapter 5  Enforcement and remedies" ;
