concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-252-ss-2 cml:asserts concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-252-ss-2-logic-argumentation-3 .
concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-252-ss-2-logic-argumentation-3 a cml:LogicApplication ;
