doc:sch-2-sec-271-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "271(5) Action for damages against manufacturers of goods" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) If:  (a) the guarantee under section 58 or 59(1) applies to a supply of goods to a consumer; and  (b) the guarantee is not complied with; an affected person in relation to the goods may, by action against the manufacturer of the goods, recover damages from the manufacturer." ;
    cof:pageNumber "364"^^xsd:integer .

concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-271-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "271(6) Action for damages against manufacturers of goods"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-271-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) If an affected person in relation to goods has, in accordance with an express warranty given or made by the manufacturer of the goods, required the manufacturer to remedy a failure to comply with a guarantee referred to in subsection (1), (3) or (5):  (a) by repairing the goods; or  (b) by replacing the goods with goods of an identical type; then, despite that subsection, the affected person is not entitled to commence an action under that subsection to recover damages of a kind referred to in section 272(1)(a) unless the manufacturer has refused or failed to remedy the failure, or has failed to remedy the failure within a reasonable time." ;
    skos:definition "(6) If an affected person in relation to goods has, in accordance with an express warranty given or made by the manufacturer of the goods, required the manufacturer to remedy a failure to comply with a guarantee referred to in subsection (1), (3) or (5):  (a) by repairing the goods; or  (b) by replacing the goods with goods of an identical type; then, despite that subsection, the affected person is not entitled to commence an action under that subsection to recover damages of a kind referred to in section 272(1)(a) unless the manufacturer has refused or failed to remedy the failure, or has failed to remedy the failure within a reasonable time."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "44fa1778c1260ddd2e8bf89b7bd438e8f01d8343fdd6639ad77429793a26f093" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-271 ;
    cof:pageNumber "364"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Manufacturer must remedy failure to comply with guarantee within a reasonable time." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.364" ;
