    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-278-ss-1 ;
    values:originalText "(1) If a consumer who is a party to a linked credit contract suffers loss or damage as a result of:  (a) a misrepresentation relating to the credit provided under that linked credit contract, or to a supply of goods or services (a related supply) to which that contract relates; or  (b) a breach of the linked credit contract, or of a contract for a related supply; or  (c) the failure of consideration in relation to the linked credit contract, or to a contract for a related supply; or  (d) a failure to comply with a guarantee that applies, under section 54, 55, 56, 57, 60, 61 or 62, in relation to a related supply; or  (e) a breach of a warranty that is implied in the linked credit contract by section 12ED of the Australian Securities and Investments Commission Act 2001; the linked credit provider who is a party to the contract, and the supplier of a related supply, are jointly and severally liable to the consumer for the amount of the loss or damage." ;
    skos:definition "(1) If a consumer who is a party to a linked credit contract suffers loss or damage as a result of:  (a) a misrepresentation relating to the credit provided under that linked credit contract, or to a supply of goods or services (a related supply) to which that contract relates; or  (b) a breach of the linked credit contract, or of a contract for a related supply; or  (c) the failure of consideration in relation to the linked credit contract, or to a contract for a related supply; or  (d) a failure to comply with a guarantee that applies, under section 54, 55, 56, 57, 60, 61 or 62, in relation to a related supply; or  (e) a breach of a warranty that is implied in the linked credit contract by section 12ED of the Australian Securities and Investments Commission Act 2001; the linked credit provider who is a party to the contract, and the supplier of a related supply, are jointly and severally liable to the consumer for the amount of the loss or damage."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "43eb3accba4e0d19957daf5d0350e275eb75d1e2b7f869a01521170c951f1e89" ;
