concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-283 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "283 Enforcement of judgments etc."@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-283 ;
    values:originalText "(1) If, in joint liability proceedings, judgment is given against a supplier and a linked credit provider, the judgment must not be enforced against the credit provider unless a written demand made  Schedule 2  The Australian Consumer Law Chapter 5  Enforcement and remedies" ;
    skos:definition "(1) If, in joint liability proceedings, judgment is given against a supplier and a linked credit provider, the judgment must not be enforced against the credit provider unless a written demand made  Schedule 2  The Australian Consumer Law Chapter 5  Enforcement and remedies"@en ;
