concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-288 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "288 Application of amendments relating to lay-by agreements"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-288 ;
    values:originalText "The amendments made by items 1 to 8 and 10 to 15 of Schedule 7 to the Consumer Credit Legislation Amendment (Enhancements) Act 2012 apply to lay-by agreements entered into on or after the commencement of those items." ;
