    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-303 ;
    values:originalText "consumer guarantee failures  (1) The amendments made by Part 1 of Schedule 4 to the Treasury Laws Amendment (2020 Measures No. 6) Act 2020 apply in relation to goods supplied under a contract entered into on or after the day that that Part commences.  (2) The amendments made by Part 1 of Schedule 4 to the Treasury Laws Amendment (2020 Measures No. 6) Act 2020 apply in relation to services supplied under a contract entered into on or after the day that that Part commences.  Schedule 2  The Australian Consumer Law Chapter 6  Application and transitional provisions" ;
